      "lang": "python",
      "code": "class Circle:\n    pi = 3.14159                    # 类属性\n\n    def __init__(self, r):\n        self._r = r                 # 实例属性（下划线表示内部）\n\n    @property\n    def area(self):                 # 像属性一样访问，实际调方法\n        return self.pi * self._r ** 2\n\n    @area.setter\n    def area(self, v):\n        self._r = (v / self.pi) ** 0.5\n\n    __slots__ = (\"_r\",)             # 限制实例属性，省内存\n\nCircle(2).area                      # 不带括号",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki css-variables\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">class</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> Circle</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    pi </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 3.14159</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">                    # 类属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    def</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\">self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">,</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\"> r</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">        self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">_r </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> r                 </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># 实例属性（下划线表示内部）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">    @</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">property</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    def</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> area</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\">self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">):                 </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># 像属性一样访问，实际调方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">        return</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">pi </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">*</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">_r </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">**</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">    @area</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">setter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">    def</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> area</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\">self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">,</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-parameter)\"> v</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">        self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">_r </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> (v </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">/</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> self</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">pi) </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">**</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">    __slots__</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\"> =</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> (</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"_r\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">,</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">)             </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># 限制实例属性，省内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">Circle</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">2</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">).</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">area                      </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># 不带括号</span></span></code></pre>",
